;THE CRYSTALS USED IN THIS STUDY WERE GROWN FROM POTASSIUM
PHOSPHATE WITH 2 MILLIMOLAR FRUCTOSE-6-PHOSPHATE.  FOR THIS
LIGANDED STRUCTURE, THE CRYSTALS WERE SOAKED IN
FRUCTOSE-6-PHOSPHATE (F6P) AND ADP/MG IN POTASSIUM
TARTRATE.  F6P 323 AND THE EFFECTOR SITE ADP 326 ARE
TREATED AS FULLY OCCUPIED WHILE ADP 324 IS TREATED AS HALF
OCCUPIED.
;
